{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Prompt (Ai) 是一款管理與整理 AI 提示詞的助手工具，內建由專業提示詞工程師與開發者持續更新的數千條提示詞，適合經常使用各類 AI 工具、需要快速找到合用指令的讀者。你可瀏覽、收藏及分享提示詞，亦可建立與編輯專屬內容。原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-181.webp\">\n<h2>提示詞分類瀏覽與收藏</h2>\n<p>首頁按類型展示提示詞，點按即可查看詳情；收藏頁同樣按類型整理已儲存的提示詞，方便日後重複使用。我的提示詞頁面集中顯示自行建立或從其他平台複製的內容，並提供新增畫面，欄位清晰簡單，讓你輕鬆加入、編輯及刪除自己的提示詞，並解釋主要 AI 工具的用途。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-326-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-327-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-328-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-329-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-330-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Prompt (Ai)</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T23:39:13.642122+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T23:16:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T17:17:34.745790+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:37.194887+00:00","content_hash":"bb3988c4aaab98eb2b464d2f5fb9ffc4d1e6e5a41cd96a3e3671c5d654e5921f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}